*.jl.cov
*.jl.*.cov
*.jl.mem
*~
.DS_Store
.vscode/

# Documenter.jl build output/lockfile (docs/ -- API reference)
/docs/build/
/docs/Manifest.toml

# Quarto site build output/cache (manual/ -- description, architecture, tutorial)
#
# `manual/docs/` is deliberately NOT ignored, unlike every other build product here. The
# paragraph-search tutorial executes Julia against corpora that are themselves gitignored --
# 827k paragraphs, an hour and a network connection to rebuild -- so no CI can render it. The
# rendered HTML is the only form of that page that can be published, which makes it source for
# publishing purposes even though it is output for every other purpose. Re-render and commit it
# when the pages change: XDG_RUNTIME_DIR=$(mktemp -d) quarto render manual
/manual/.quarto/
/manual/_freeze/
**/*.quarto_ipynb
